[{"id":"26113","date":"2026-11-11T10:22:58+00:00","text":"Nico Rosberg reveals just how far he went psychologically to beat Lewis Hamilton at Mercedes. “Lewis is a momentum guy. You need to cut his momentum. That’s super important, as soon as possible, because if he gets going with his momentum, he’s like unstoppable for a while.” Rosberg explained that even dominating Hamilton in free practice mattered because it could unsettle him and potentially trigger a negative spiral. For Rosberg, the battle wasn’t just about winning races. It was about never letting Hamilton build confidence in the first place. @formula1","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/apzwsPrKkg14eN1DMw6tDzU6JV5qIetDe9iqz2WzjXeVJKR4sWujW5hogrdywuKWSjwhg5BCbWwX-aeboN1-gUJejGSn5AD1wvxBJ5gK17eK1fWU7YF1UclrYMxhxUSv0DZJmOUv2X7YPw0wY8rpFbNGXLeBezRw73qWaMxNd7ZOznNWvMeJMJcC5LtmxWhEbtyj0XVWEVAId7JMjLTNm500x3PNKoegPCW1J25nOzfgSG7ZvzccQozOQtONRh9ADUqp4MoTpbcCMDNuTkTeo_rHdkMNJWi9OYKGsShtysjstSyG7o9CbXbSoQaajX1KLwOdZNNzLpc4P8izd3zEWQ","video":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/54e52641df.mp4?token=cAaCMk-EB8RR0ib5cJEqfSuGk3P6d-W1ko-A4vbWO3OTyP5Dls_LSAapTP4udrOKpNEIpsipP9jtidY7MmeuISYbKyiY9fZN7viO0pLWCfQXGZUtlKcewrQ6nVk9fX-QyKCGbHhzGMsDknAUSKaBlFWT5UpjU7cnHJLA8O0jJo0dGeRnY9xHM0zL6eKpW0pHYwn6sJuqhsimFWQXKCiYomWs-dNZqkpr-yVWTc23kf64DI5fbHc2mh5uCidB90rAImrpVDGG3NA5vRDVjikPiR5pxwiXnPHUeF8Rm3kkvdVk5txSvYoFp3NWaXoZrB6uTY1pz0Sl1zaTQxgQ1qS5lKgBso654pp1FGLnm9yx9wmRo1VmBIA65I9QzDPyrCM32P10uyYd2MilZxQdBCRVU6c8DGlB1Qi7HtdTwYHyryVYt3QRiXtzkp1shGnxE7N1-VGyiXtdnpbk5TzX0go4cpTlv93RNwoFyxSiTT4WeycgemHZJ6yUmCTsMwhfNpn37pSKZC90wy7pYy4KQgs9N5p14SaQXZwdIhiQE0DhC0SuvgRWB7rDqJiwc5T6Iybd0PuCCmhrh9JIWcgjTRWCnZFMBn4D-LhNzqgFbLg8dr_cqWearB7zAZM8jxBmu1yCTMKBgH9StVmieRL2dqCsucrg-FL32m8nI0uMvAOyorU","hasVideo":true},{"id":"26112","date":"2026-11-11T04:09:40+00:00","text":"Imola will NOT host the 2026 Formula 1 season finale. Qatar and Abu Dhabi remain on the calendar, with the FIA preparing for both races to go ahead as scheduled. However, uncertai